    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>:</mo><mi>max</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8804;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#8804;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><img src=\"assets\\st0105_ff7c6f8bca3a.png\" style=\"width: 345px; height: 300px;\" /></p><p>So, the area of the region is</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mn>2</mn></msubsup><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></msup><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mi>&#8467;</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mfrac><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></msup><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>-</mo><msubsup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mi>ln</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mfenced><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></mfenced><mo>-</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>log</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></msub><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>ln</mi><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mfenced><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>log</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></msub><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>ln</mi><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>,</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#947;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#947;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p>"
